Input: {"correlation_id": "ETH-USDT-1h-1790002799999", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790008200000, "account": {"equity": "9993.047729133463", "available_margin": "9905.245703133462400000000000", "currency": "USDT", "position_mode": "HEDGE", "as_of_ms": 1790008200000}, "position": {"position_id": "wf-main-5", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2761.07", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790008200000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "1.805453904"}, "positions": [{"position_id": "wf-main-5", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2761.07", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790008200000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "1.805453904"}], "executor_state": {"as_of_ms": 1790008200000, "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "fills_read_status": "available", "executors": [{"executor_id": "wf-exec-9", "status": "RUNNING", "trading_pair": "ETH-USDT", "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "position_id": "wf-main-5", "config": {"stop_price": "2718.090000000000000000000000", "target_price": "2812.139999999999999999999999"}}]}, "open_orders": [], "recent_fills": [{"fill_id": "wf-fill-9", "order_id": "wf-fill-9", "position_id": "wf-main-5", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "status": "FILLED", "quantity": "0.159", "price": "2749.714944", "fee": "0.1748818704384", "filled_at_ms": 1790005679999}], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790002799999, "market_context": {"regime": "bull-trend", "phase": "breakout-spike with a tight range at the highs", "location": "price holds above the twice-tested H4 2700 zone (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) inside a 21-bar M15 tight range (bar 98 low 2702.56 to bar 119 high 2747.76); first opposing level 2771 (D1 bar-89 spike high), then 2850 (M15 bar 98 / H4 bar 120 high)", "always_in": "long", "notes": "H4 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789991999999) and D1 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789948799999) both read bull-trend/breakout-spike; D1 context is used only for the 2771 spike-high location, and raw closed M15/H1 bars are the entry evidence."}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback: buy the breakout of the 21-bar M15 tight range that has held above the broken 2700 H4 double top", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (range high)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2747.76", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790001900000, "close_time_ms": 1790002799999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low (low of the recent higher-low cluster 2718.09/2720.15/2718.23; back into the middle of the tight range)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2718.09", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1790000100000, "close_time_ms": 1790000999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open 2733.06, close 2734.92) is the highest close of the 21-bar consolidation and takes out the prior range highs: 2739.54 (bar 112), 2741.55 (bar 115), 2742.56 (bar 118), then 2747.76 (bar 119) - range highs are rising into the close.", "The M15 range since the spike bar 98 (open 2708.33, high 2850, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) has held entirely above 2702.56, i.e. above the H4 2700 zone that had been tagged twice (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) - a tight consolidation above a broken double top, not a pullback below it.", "H1 follow-through per the H4 transition condition: H1 bars 117-119 (open_time 1789992000000 / 1789995600000 / 1789999200000) closed 2734.09, 2734.13, 2734.92, all above the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15, with lows 2719.08 / 2720.15 / 2718.09 above 2700.", "H1 bar 119 (open 2734.63, high 2747.76, low 2718.09, close 2734.92) makes a higher high versus H1 bar 118 high 2741.55 and closes at the top of the last five H1 bars (lows 2709.56, 2713.04, 2719.08, 2720.15, 2718.09 all hold above 2700).", "M15 lows have stopped falling under the range: 2718.23 (bar 116), 2718.09 (bar 117), 2731.83 (bar 118), 2731.83 (bar 119), so a stop below 2718.09 is a defensible structural invalidation with a defined 29.67-point risk from the 2747.76 trigger."], "evidence_against": ["M15 bar 98 printed 2850 and closed 2739.13, a 147.44-point bar with a 110.87-point upper tail; the whole 21-bar range sits inside that tail, so the buy trigger 2747.76 is still 102.24 below a level that was just rejected.", "H4 bar 120 (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) left a 126.85-point upper tail with no follow-through bar in the window; the H4 context flags two earlier upside spikes (bar 61 high 2680, bar 81 high 2609.02) that were fully retraced.", "Overhead structure crowds the setup versus its invalidation: 2747.76 is only 5.20 above the prior M15 range high 2742.56 and only 23.24 below the 2771 D1 spike high, against a 29.67-point stop distance.", "Bar 119 is a weak breakout bar, not a bull trend bar closing on its high: its close 2734.92 sits in the lower ~19% of its 2731.83-2747.76 range with a 12.84 upper tail.", "The 21-bar M15 range is only about 45 points (1.6%) and oscillates around the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15 - consistent with balance at the breakout level, and tight-range breakouts frequently fail without a strong breakout bar."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the M15 tight range resolves upward or becomes a final flag: no bar in the supplied packet closes above 2747.76, so the breakout is untriggered and unconfirmed.", "The would-be signal bar is already printed (bar 119) and is marginal (new high by 5.20 with a 12.84 upper tail); a stronger bull bar closing on its high would raise confidence in the same trigger.", "The D1 context is 15 hours older than the frozen decision time and its 2771/2557 levels are contextual descriptions; the D1 spike high 2771 was exceeded only by a wick (M15 bar 98 high 2850) with no close above it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A M15 close back below 2731.83 (bar 119 low) and then below 2718.09 (bar 117 low) would mark a failed breakout of the range high and void the long case.", "A M15/H1 close below 2702.56 (bar 98 low) would break the three-hour acceptance above the H4 2700 zone and return price to the prior H4 wide range.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2718.09 and 2747.76 without exceeding 2747.76 would keep the tight-range read and argue against a breakout.", "A M15 close above 2747.76 with the low holding above 2731.83 would confirm the breakout and shift the focus to 2771 and then 2850."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "NO_TRADE", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790006399999, "market_context": {"primary_regime": "bull-trend", "phase": "breakout-spike into a tight range at the highs; second upside spike rejected", "always_in": "long per supplied H4/D1 context", "location": "M15 close 2754.31 sits only 6.55 above the 2747.76 top of the 24-bar M15 range (bars 95-118) and 40.69 below bar 119's high 2795; the 2850 spike high (M15 bar 94 / H1 bar 113) is untested since", "h4_context_freshness": "stale", "d1_context_freshness": "current", "notes": "Raw M15/H1 bars are authoritative here; supplied H4/D1 contexts were used only for regime and location, not as votes."}, "setup": {"type": "none", "trigger_status": "absent", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "poor", "no_trade_reason": "weak_signal"}, "decision_timeframe": null, "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "none", "trigger": null, "invalidation": null, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open_time 1790005500000) opened 2744.2, spiked to high 2795, then closed 2754.31 - only 10.47 above its low 2743.84, the bottom ~20% of its 51.16-point range: an upside spike that was sold, not a bull bar closing on its high.", "The high zone has already been rejected once: M15 bar 94 (open_time 1789983000000) opened 2708.33, spiked to high 2850 and closed 2739.13, a 110.87-point upper tail; H1 bar 113 (open_time 1789981200000, high 2850, close 2720.66) and H1 bar 119 (high 2795, close 2754.31) show two rejection spikes in the same area.", "M15 bars 95-118 (open_times 1789983900000-1789998300000) form a 24-bar overlap with highs capped at 2747.76 (bar 115) and lows 2702.56-2720.15; bar 119 closes only 6.55 above that range top, so acceptance of the breakout is unproven.", "A bull stop above 2795.01 would risk roughly 51 points to bar 119's low 2743.84 with the 2850 spike high only about 55 points above, so nearby opposing structure crowds the continuation case relative to its invalidation (Trader's Equation check).", "Between the two spikes price spent 24 M15 bars overlapping rather than trending, which is the footprint of a climax/trading-range pause at the highs rather than immediate trend resumption."], "evidence_against": ["Bull continuation case (strongest counter to standing aside): M15 bar 119's close 2754.31 is the highest close of the M15 window and is above the 24-bar range top 2747.76 (bar 115), with rising M15 lows into it - 2718.09 (bar 112), 2719.37 (bar 113), 2730.01 (bar 118), 2743.84 (bar 119) - so a stop above 2795.01 is a legitimate breakout-continuation trigger inside an always-in-long H4/D1 context.", "Bear fade case: bar 119 closing near its low after rejecting 2795 is a reversal-type bar at the top of a two-spike leg, and a stop below 2743.84 points at the 2730.01 (bar 118) and 2718.09 (bar 112) range lows; that trade is nonetheless counter-trend against the supplied H4/D1 bull context.", "H1 bar 119 (open_time 1790002800000, open 2734.92, high 2795, low 2730.01, close 2754.31) still holds above the 2700 breakout area (H1 bar 104 high 2700), so no trend break has occurred at the decision time."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["H4 context was stale at the snapshot and no raw H4 read was completed in this run, so structure above 2700 was read from raw H1/M15 bars rather than a fresh 120-bar H4 window.", "Bar 119 is a single M15 bar; its follow-through is outside the frozen window, so the breakout attempt is unresolved rather than failed.", "D1 context decision_time 1789948799999 predates the 2795 high, so its last close 2642.90 does not describe the current price."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 close above 2795 (bar 119 high) that keeps its low above 2743.84 would mark breakout acceptance above the 24-bar range and shift the read toward bull continuation.", "An M15 close below 2743.84 (bar 119 low), especially followed by a close below 2730, would flag rejection of the range-top breakout and open the 2718.09-2702.56 range base.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2747.76 and 2795 without a new high above 2795 would confirm a trading range at the highs (final-flag risk) rather than a breakout.", "A close below 2702.56 (M15 bar 94 low) would break the higher-low sequence running from the 2850 spike and support a failed-breakout read."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789948799999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["Window opens at 2116.86 and falls to 1368.42 (bar 13 low, close 1568.55), then reverses; final close 2642.90 is about +24.9% versus the first open and about +93% above the window low.", "Bars 87-89 are the spike: 1916.51 to 2252.16, 2252.20 to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "evidence_against": ["The breakout is only three bars; the preceding 27 bars overlap heavily and the region 2357-2557 can still be read as the operating trading range rather than broken.", "Two earlier upside probes failed to hold: bar 110 high 2680 closed 2514.72, bar 113 high 2609.02 closed 2514.07, so upside spikes in this region have recently been rejected.", "2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the whole post-spike section can be read as one broad trading range whose upper extreme has not been exceeded.", "Bar 119 makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700) with a lower tail to 2568.16, a pause rather than a strong continuation bar, and bar 114 had just traded down to 2358.62 four bars before the breakout."], "uncertainty": ["V2 D1 context adapted for the V1 PM input."]}, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1790005679999, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-5"], "reason": "The snapshot is coherent: one MAIN LONG leg (wf-main-5, 0.159) matches the executor's position_id, hedge_state is single_main with no unresolved legs, margin_health is SAFE, and management_policy sets strategy_stop_required false, so the absence of an open stop order is policy-compliant. The recorded premise (breakout above the M15 range high 2747.76 with structural invalidation at 2718.09) is not contradicted: the most recent closed M15 bars hold above 2718.09 and the 1790004600000 bar (close 2744.21) closes near its high after the 2730.50 pullback low. No unmet management condition requires an allowed intervention, so HOLD is the safest coherent step.", "evidence": {"observations": ["Single MAIN position wf-main-5, ETH-USDT LONG 0.159, entry 2749.714944, mark 2749.44, unrealized PnL -0.043716096; ownership_role MAIN and as_of_ms 1790005679999 equal decision_time_ms.", "hedge_state: structure_status single_main, unresolved false, main_side LONG, hedge_side null, hedge_ratio 0, net_exposure 437.16096 USD, gross_exposure_usd 437.16096, ratio_basis absolute_mark_notional.", "executor wf-exec-9 is RUNNING for position wf-main-5 with config stop_price 2718.090000 and target_price 2812.140000, matching the recorded invalidation low 2718.09 (M15 bar 117 low); open_orders is empty and recent_fills shows one FILLED 0.159 buy at 2749.714944 (fee 0.17488) for wf-main-5.", "management_policy brooks-pm-v1:brooks-walkforward-10d, strategy_stop_required false, allowed_management_actions include HOLD; margin_health SAFE with equity 9991.20 and available_margin 9903.77; latest_market_context D1 still reads bull-trend/breakout-spike with price below the 2771 spike high; market_analysis is null.", "Latest closed M15 bars: 1790002800000 close 2747.33 (bull bar at the range high), 1790003700000 close 2731.84 (bar rejecting 2747.33 down to low 2730.50), 1790004600000 close 2744.21 (bull bar closing near its high, low 2730.01); price remains above the 2718.09 invalidation and below the 2771 overhead level."], "evidence_for": ["The documented premise is intact on the supplied closed bars: since the 2747.76 range-high takeout, price has not closed below the 2718.09 invalidation, and the newest closed bar (1790004600000, 